ml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"dissent\">\n<author id=\"b745-10\">Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"Ab3\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"b745-11\">Adhering to my view that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#231\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 231</a></span> (1976), I would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}